  "summary": "The experiment tested an RNA-only model using PCA encoding on single-profile data without image modalities or fusion. Validation accuracy of 0.4849 suggests moderate performance, with validation F1 of 0.4639 supporting this baseline. Uncertainty remains about how multimodal components or advanced aggregation methods might improve performance, as no comparative experiments have been conducted."
